WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.230
Tiko aims at the left engine.

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.370
[Three rising notes] A green diamond
splits the shot into three pearls.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.620
A second diamond sends two more flying.

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.120
[Basket chimes] Two catches. The shot
passes 2,500 and earns another pearl.

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:09.300
The last pearl falls.
18 pegs lit · 2,885 points
